## Common quick fixes — try if log doesn't help

### Fix 1: Remove stale PID file (most common cause)

```bash
brew services stop postgresql@15 ; rm -f /opt/homebrew/var/postgresql@15/postmaster.pid && brew services start postgresql@15 && sleep 3 && psql -U odoo -l
```

### Fix 2: Reinstall postgres@15 (nuclear option, but databases preserved)

```bash
brew services stop postgresql@15 ; brew reinstall postgresql@15 && brew services start postgresql@15 && sleep 5 && psql -U odoo -l
```

